# Environment Variables for TON Web3 Payments Solution

## Production (Vercel)

# Database (Auto-populated by Vercel Postgres)
POSTGRES_PRISMA_URL="postgresql://..."
POSTGRES_URL_NON_POOLING="postgresql://..."

# Authentication
JWT_SECRET="your-secret-key-min-32-characters-long"

# TON Integration
NEXT_PUBLIC_TON_NETWORK="testnet"

# App Configuration
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL="https://ton-web3-payments.vercel.app"

# Optional: Monitoring
SENTRY_DSN="your-sentry-dsn"

## Development (Local)

# Database (Use SQLite for local development)
POSTGRES_PRISMA_URL="file:./dev.db"

# Authentication
JWT_SECRET="local-dev-secret-key-min-32-chars-abcdefghijk"

# App Configuration
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL="http://localhost:3000"
NEXT_PUBLIC_TON_NETWORK="testnet"